type: dataset
title: "Dog breed lifespan figures from four open-access studies"
abstract: "Lifespan figures by dog breed from four open-access studies, one row per study and breed, with the figures exactly as each paper's table prints them. The breed pages of Dog Breed Data show these rows beside kennel-club figures."
